entral, Service Desk, Returns, IT Assets) using Next.js 16/React 19, Vite, Node.js/Express, Python/FastAPI, Supabase (RLS), and Cloudflare Pages + Render deployment.\n- Implemented a 9 AI agent squad (orchestrator, 5 specialized implementers, 3 independent validators) in a maker-checker model with Claude Code: least privilege, anti-hallucination protocols, and human review escalation.\n- Established quality as a delivery gate: 58 Pytest suites (E2E flows, authentication, LGPD) and 35 Playwright visual regression assertions, linting, and design system drift checks across 5 packages (100% approved in go-live audit).\n- Built 10 Python automations integrated with WinThor (Oracle), including 4 inventory integration robots for pharmaceutical operators (Eurofarma, Eurofarma Generic, Smartped, Momenta) via EDI Pharma Link and FTP/SFTP.","metricsSummary":"Highlight metrics at **Distribuidora Mais Saúde**: **FTP_SYNC Reduction: -99% (6h ➔ 10s)** • **WinThor Robots: 10 robôs** • **Test Suites: 58 Pytest + 35 E2E** • **Unified Systems: 4 em 1 (SSO)**.","currentJob":"**Current Job — Distribuidora Mais Saúde (Jun/2026 - Present):** Currently, Anderson works at **Distribuidora Mais Saúde** as **IT Intern — Full-Stack, Automation & AI** (Software Engineering, AI Agents & WinThor Integrations), where he architected and builds **Central Grupo Mais (SSO monorepo unifying 4 internal systems)**, **10 Python robots integrated with TOTVS WinThor ERP (Oracle)** (including **FTP_SYNC reducing 6h to <10s, -99%**), the **9-agent AI squad (Maker-Checker with Claude Code)**, and **58 Pytest + 35 Playwright tests**."}'::jsonb, 5, now()),
