  ('project-sistema-chamados-mais-saude:en', 'en', 'project', 'Corporate Service Desk System — Multi-Tier Service Desk Platform with Granular RBAC and Recharts BI', 'Project: Corporate Service Desk System (Full-Stack & BI).
