  ('project-sistema-devolucoes-ia:en', 'en', 'project', 'AI-Powered Returns & Reverse Logistics — Intelligent Reverse Logistics with LLM Diagnostics, Pareto Curve & TV Mode', 'Project: AI-Powered Returns & Reverse Logistics (AI & Logistics).
