  ('project-rpa-fiscal-3coracoes:en', 'en', 'project', 'RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction — 5 Python Robots for 15,000 XMLs/mo Extraction and Automated CND Certification', 'Project: RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction (Automation & RPA).
Challenge: The tax team spent hundreds of manual hours downloading invoices from government portals and typing data into spreadsheets, with severe compliance and penalty risks.
