Result & Impact: Over 15,000 XMLs processed monthly with 99.85% precision and 200+ manual hours saved for the tax department. Tax inconsistency risk eradicated and team productivity redirected to strategic financial planning.
Metrics: Monthly Volume: 15.000+ XMLs | Hours Saved: 200h+ | SEFAZ Accuracy: 99.85%
Technologies: Python, RPA, Pandas, Selenium, lxml, BeautifulSoup, Excel Automation.', '**RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction**: Suite of 5 production Python RPA robots at Grupo 3corações for automated CND renewals on tax portals, bulk XML extraction (15,000+/mo), and direct corporate spreadsheet reconciliation. **Solution:** Built workers using Selenium, lxml, BeautifulSoup, and Pandas for headless browsing, async downloading, strict schema validation, and automated executive report generation. **Result:** Over 15,000 XMLs processed monthly with 99.85% precision and 200+ manual hours saved for the tax department.', '#projetos', ARRAY['rpa-fiscal-3coracoes', 'fiscal', '3coracoes', 'motor rpa & extração fiscal (grupo 3corações)', 'rpa engine & tax data extraction', 'python', 'rpa', 'pandas', 'selenium', 'lxml', 'beautifulsoup', 'excel automation']::text[], ARRAY['rpa_fiscal_3coracoes', 'python', 'rpa', 'pandas', 'selenium', 'lxml', 'beautifulsoup', 'excel automation']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"challenge":"**Challenge in RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction:** The tax team spent hundreds of manual hours downloading invoices from government portals and typing data into spreadsheets, with severe compliance and penalty risks.","solution":"**Solution implemented in RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction:** Built workers using Selenium, lxml, BeautifulSoup, and Pandas for headless browsing, async downloading, strict schema validation, and automated executive report generation.","architecture":"**Architecture & Stack of RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction (Python, RPA, Pandas, Selenium, lxml, BeautifulSoup, Excel Automation):**\n- Parsing & XML: lxml, BeautifulSoup4, SEFAZ Schemas\n- Web Automation: Headless Selenium, Requests, CND Capture\n- ETL & Data: Pandas, OpenPyXL, export for accounting reconciliation","resultImpact":"**Results & Impact of RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction:** Over 15,000 XMLs processed monthly with 99.85% precision and 200+ manual hours saved for the tax department. Tax inconsistency risk eradicated and team productivity redirected to strategic financial planning. (**Monthly Volume: 15.000+ XMLs** • **Hours Saved: 200h+** • **SEFAZ Accuracy: 99.85%**).","role":"**Role in RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction:** Anderson served as **RPA Developer & Automation Analyst**, leading from architectural design to production delivery with automated quality gates (**58 Pytest tests** and **35 Playwright assertions**).","metricsSummary":"Metrics for **RPA Engine & Tax Data Extraction**: **Monthly Volume: 15.000+ XMLs** | **Hours Saved: 200h+** | **SEFAZ Accuracy: 99.85%**."}'::jsonb, 5, now()),
  ('project-squad-agentes-ia:pt', 'pt', 'project', 'Squad de Agentes de IA Autônomos — Arquitetura Multiagente com Memória Compartilhada e Orquestrador 24/7', 'Projeto: Squad de Agentes de IA Autônomos (IA & Sistemas Multiagente).
Desafio: Construir um sistema multiagente resiliente capaz de colaborar na resolução de problemas complexos sem perder contexto ou entrar em loops infinitos de alucinação.
Papel: Pesquisador & Engenheiro de IA
Solução Técnica: Implementação em Node.js com a API do Google Gemini, sistema de arquivos como barramento de memória compartilhada, máquina de estados finitos para delegação entre agentes e daemon de supervisão com PM2.
Arquitetura:
- Core: Node.js, Google Gemini API, PM2 Daemon
- Memória: Context Bus compartilhado em JSON com histórico conversacional
- Orquestração: Padrão maker-checker e validação de contratos de saída com Zod
