Metrics: Uptime: 24/7 (PM2) | LLM Model: Google Gemini | Orchestration: Multiagente
Technologies: Node.js, Google Gemini API, PM2, Multi-Agent, Prompt Engineering, TypeScript.', '**Autonomous AI Agent Squad**: Multi-agent architecture built from scratch to master the foundational mechanics of LLM orchestration: specialized role-based personas, shared JSON context memory, and 24/7 PM2 process management. **Solution:** Implemented in Node.js using Google Gemini API, filesystem-based shared context bus, finite state machine for agent handoffs, and PM2 process supervision. **Result:** Stable 24/7 autonomous execution with distributed task handling and highly consistent analytical reporting.', '#projetos', ARRAY['squad-agentes-ia', 'squad', 'agentes', 'squad de agentes de ia autônomos', 'autonomous ai agent squad', 'node.js', 'google gemini api', 'pm2', 'multi-agent', 'prompt engineering', 'typescript']::text[], ARRAY['squad_agentes_ia', 'node.js', 'google gemini api', 'pm2', 'multi-agent', 'prompt engineering', 'typescript']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"challenge":"**Challenge in Autonomous AI Agent Squad:** Build a resilient multi-agent collective capable of collaborating on complex tasks without losing context or entering hallucination loops.","solution":"**Solution implemented in Autonomous AI Agent Squad:** Implemented in Node.js using Google Gemini API, filesystem-based shared context bus, finite state machine for agent handoffs, and PM2 process supervision.","architecture":"**Architecture & Stack of Autonomous AI Agent Squad (Node.js, Google Gemini API, PM2, Multi-Agent, Prompt Engineering, TypeScript):**\n- Core: Node.js, Google Gemini API, PM2 Daemon\n- Memory: Shared JSON Context Bus with conversational memory buffers\n- Orchestration: Maker-checker pattern and output contract enforcement via Zod","resultImpact":"**Results & Impact of Autonomous AI Agent Squad:** Stable 24/7 autonomous execution with distributed task handling and highly consistent analytical reporting. Solid foundational mastery applied directly to AI-assisted corporate engineering and the 9-agent squad at Mais Saúde. (**Uptime: 24/7 (PM2)** • **LLM Model: Google Gemini** • **Orchestration: Multiagente**).","role":"**Role in Autonomous AI Agent Squad:** Anderson served as **AI Researcher & Engineer**, leading from architectural design to production delivery with automated quality gates (**58 Pytest tests** and **35 Playwright assertions**).","metricsSummary":"Metrics for **Autonomous AI Agent Squad**: **Uptime: 24/7 (PM2)** | **LLM Model: Google Gemini** | **Orchestration: Multiagente**."}'::jsonb, 5, now()),
